                                "sense_id": "8cb5271d-53ec-3231-bfe3-1ea175073c53",
                                "text": "Myhill gets fingertips onto it and helps the rasping drive onto the bar and over or a corner."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e63a49f-4bb6-4a88-a84e-09dc057245b3",
                                "sense_id": "8cb5271d-53ec-3231-bfe3-1ea175073c53",
                                "text": "Celta then levelled following a crisp move between Daniel Wass, Guidetti and Orellana, the Chilean sending a rasping drive high beyond Casilla."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6a86498-f445-4963-b9b6-0f31ebdc3efc",
                                "sense_id": "8cb5271d-53ec-3231-bfe3-1ea175073c53",
                                "text": "Zeki Amdouni had a rasping long-range drive parried away by David Raya"
